  memoryId: MEM_001
  title: The Name Beneath the Stone
  description: The ruin stone carries eight seats, not seven. Someone has ground the eighth name away, patiently, with a blade - not to deface it, but to finish it. Underneath the damage the carving is still legible in the way a scar is legible. You do not know the name. You are certain you have said it before.
